  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the kinds of trust that a device trust pairing request can enable.</summary>
    <remarks>The values correspond to the <c>TRUST_TYPE_*</c> constants in Android's <c>CompanionDeviceManager</c>. Pass them in the <c>trustTypes</c> array of <see cref="M:Android.Companion.CompanionDeviceManager.RequestDeviceTrustPairing(System.Int32,Android.Companion.OutOfBandPairingRequest,System.Int32[],Java.Util.Concurrent.IExecutor,Android.Companion.CompanionDeviceManager.TrustPairingCallback)" />. <see cref="M:Android.Companion.AssociationInfo.GetTrustTypes" /> returns the enabled values. See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/companion/CompanionDeviceManager#TRUST_TYPE_SCREEN_AUTOMATION">Android reference</a></format>.</remarks>
  </Docs>
